sequenceDiagram
  actor Player
  participant CLI as Client CLI
  participant API as Client API
  participant Server as Server Core
  participant Account as Account Module
  Player->>CLI: Enter LOGIN command
  CLI->>API: clientLogin(name)
  API->>Server: LOGIN name
  Server->>Account: Validate identity and policy
  Account-->>Server: Accepted or rejected
  Server-->>API: OK LOGIN or ERR
  API-->>CLI: Render response
  CLI-->>Player: Show status
